      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Helping a struggling family abroad is not a zero-sum game that steals from our own community; rather, it is an investment in global stability that prevents the very crises—like pandemics, refugee flows, and economic collapse—that will eventually destroy our own neighborhoods. We must reject the false choice between local and global compassion because true patriotism means recognizing that our nation's security and prosperity are inextricably linked to the health and stability of the world we live in. By funding humanitarian aid, we are not neglecting our own people; we are securing the long-term future of our own by ensuring the global system remains fair, safe, and resilient.",
      "source": "target",
